# S1 Minervini: living parameters and results log

The owner's working document for S1 (stage2-contraction-breakout). Every backtest result on S1 is
recorded here against the parameter set it used. Tuning follows the table, and nothing changes
without a recorded run. Results go here; the repo keeps only code and canonical docs.

## Ground rules

- No backtest until the code and data audit is clean (owner, 2026-10-25): "if theres data or code
  bug nothing matters".
- Window: trades from 2016-01-01 only, on point-in-time NIFTY 500 membership. Pre-2016 bars only
  warm up the indicators.
- Every parameter lives in config (the strategy version YAML, or `--set` overrides). A backtest
  never needs a code change. The output metrics are the same for every strategy.
- Choose on 2016–2021, read 2022–2026 once. One parameter at a time; pick a plateau, not a peak.

