| 2 | First partial | 33% at 3R | 33% at 3R | Same as the seed |
| 3 | Breakeven / trail stepping | Breakeven at 2R | No breakeven; step trail: stop +1R for every +1.5R (−1R → 0R at +1.5R → +1R at +3R …) | Step-trail rule added in the S1 config PR |
